      "statement": "A 90-kg obese man is consuming a carbohydrate-rich diet. Which enzyme or intermediate is likely to be increased in his body?\n1. Malonyl CoA\n2. Acetyl CoA Carboxylase\n3. PDH\n4. Citrate Lyase",
