      "statement": "A 65-year-old man with Parkinson’s disease has oropharyngeal dysphagia, recurrent aspiration pneumonitis, and excessive respiratory secretions. Chest imaging shows bilateral bronchiectasis. What is the most appropriate long-term management?",
