      "statement": "A 32-year-old man arrives at the emergency department after being stabbed in the left side of the chest. He is in acute distress with a heart rate of 120 bpm, blood pressure of 90/60 mmHg, and a respiratory rate of 28/min. Breath sounds are reduced on the right side, and a chest X-ray is provided. What is the diagnosis?",
