      "paperSession": "Nov 2024",
      "statement": "A 65-year-old diabetic man presents with breathlessness and pleural effusion. CT imaging reveals a “tree-in-bud” pattern, and pleural fluid analysis shows lymphocytic predominance with low ADA. What is most likely to be seen in an aspirate from the hilar lymph node?",
