      "statement": "Which factors are responsible for the latent period observed in a single muscle twitch?\n1. Excitation-contraction coupling\n2. Time interval from the point of stimulus to the onset of contraction\n3. Neuromuscular junction (NMJ) transmission\n4. Transfer of calcium back into the sarcoplasmic reticulum via SERCA",
