      "statement": "A 30-year-old man presents with recent fever and cough. His SpO₂ on room air is 98%, blood pressure is 110/70 mm Hg, and chest X-ray shows extensive bilateral consolidation. A nasopharyngeal swab is positive for rhinovirus. Which antibiotic therapy is most appropriate in this case?",
