      "statement": "A 10-year-old boy is admitted with severe dehydration, nausea, vomiting, urine sugar 3+, RBS 550 mg/dL, ABG showing pH of 7.1, and HCO3= 7 mmol/L. What is the appropriate line of management as per ISPAD (International Society for Pediatric and Adolescent Diabetes) guidelines?",
