      "statement": "A male patient with a history of COPD is experiencing dyspnea and arrives at the emergency department. His arterial blood gas analysis reveals a pH of 7.28, pCO₂ of 60 mmHg, and HCO₃⁻ of 28 meq/L. Based on these findings, what is the most accurate diagnosis?",
