      "paperSession": "Nov 2023",
      "statement": "A 30-year-old HIV-positive man presents with neck stiffness and optic disc swelling. CSF analysis shows a capsulated fungus, confirmed by a positive India ink stain. In this context, which of the following statements is correct?",
