      "paperSession": "Nov 2023",
      "statement": "A known RA (Rheumatoid Arthritis) patient presents to the ER with hypotension. She abruptly stopped her medications. Her vitals and labs show: HR = 110 bpm, BP = 80/40 mmHg, blood agar = 50 mg/dl, Na = 130 meq/L, K = 6 0. meq/L.What should be the most appropriate management?",
