      "statement": "Workup of a 25-year-old hotel worker shows the following profile:\n• HBsAg = Negative\n• Anti-HBs = Negative\n• HBeAg Negative\n• Anti-HBe Negative\n• Total anti-HBc = Positive What is the diagnosis?",
