      "statement": "A patient on antitubercular therapy is reassessed 10 days after starting treatment. Their AST and ALT levels are normal, serum creatinine is 0.9 mg/dL, but serum uric acid is elevated at 10 mg/ dL. What is the most appropriate modification to their management plan?",
