      "statement": "Match the following:\n1. Trisomy 13 a. GLU-VAL re-placement\n2. Trisomy 18 b. Edwards syn-drome\n3. Trisomy 21 c. Down syndrome\n4. Sickle cell anemia d. Patau syndrome",
