      "paperSession": "May 2023",
      "statement": "During a temple visit, a child with his grandmother began to cry incessantly. Medical evaluation revealed the child was in severe pain, had high blood pressure, an increased heart rate, was sweating profusely, had a persistent erection, and his skin was cool and clammy. Which treatment option is most appropriate for this patient?",
