      "statement": "A child is brought to the ER in an unconscious state after severe vomiting and abdominal pain episodes. HR = 100/min and BP = 100/60 mm Hg. Work-up shows pH = 7 2. , blood glucose 300 mg/dL, and ketones 3+. What should be the best management?",
