      "statement": "What is the most probable diagnosis for a male patient who has a persistent, itchy rash on his side that hasn’t responded to over-the-counter treatments such as Lotrimin and hydrocortisone, and who also has similar lesions on one palm and one sole, with no involvement of the oral mucosa?",
