      "statement": "An elderly vegetarian patient presents with fatigue and pallor. A peripheral smear shows macrocytic anemia, and lab findings include hemoglobin of 9 g/dL, MCV of 110 fL, elevated serum homocysteine, and normal methylmalonic acid. What is the most likely cause of this patient’s anemia?",
