      "paperSession": "May 2022",
      "statement": "What treatment measures should be included for a patient who presents with significant abdominal fluid accumulation and has been diagnosed with pancreatic necrosis?\n1. Antibiotics IV\n2. IV fluids\n3. Culture\n4. MRI\n5. Assisted drainage\n6. Laparotomy",
