      "statement": "In a culturally and linguistically diverse country like India, what steps should a physician take to communicate effectively with patients and ensure better treatment outcomes? 1 Insist on good communication 2 Insist on communication only via an interpreter 3 Treat them regardless of their cultural perceptions 4 The physician should consider the patient's religion and cultural perception",
