      "statement": "What is the most probable diagnosis in a 10-year-old boy who presents with fatigue, laboratory results showing hemoglobin of 9 g/dL, MCV 60 fL, MCH 20 pg, and a serum ferritin level of 185 µg/L, along with an elevated total leukocyte count featuring increased lymphocytes and neutrophils?",
