      "statement": "A 25-year-old woman developed heavy bleeding, visual disturbances, and a severe headache one day after an uncomplicated vaginal delivery. She later became unresponsive and required intubation and ventilation. Her vital signs showed hypotension (60/40 mmHg), tachycardia, and hypoglycemia (48 mg/dL), while her hematocrit and WBC count were normal. Which medication would most effectively reverse her condition?",
