      "paperSession": "May 2021",
      "statement": "In evaluating a patient for resistant hypertension, their blood pressure remains uncontrolled despite taking three antihypertensive drugs. Which specific class of antihypertensive medication must be included in this regimen for the diagnosis to apply?",
