      "statement": "The blood investigation of a patient is given below. What is the probable diagnosis?\n• HBsAg : Non-reactive\n• HBeAg : Non-reactive\n• IgG anti-HBcAg : Reactive\n• IgM anti-HBcAg : Non-reactive",
