      "statement": "While organizing hypertension management services at a Primary Health Center (PHC), you have 50 patients on antihypertensive therapy—40 taking amlodipine 5 mg daily and 10 taking lisinopril 10 mg daily. How many tablets are required for one month, and what would be a suitable reorder factor (RF) to ensure sufficient stock?",
