      "statement": "A 26-year-old woman with two previous vaginal deliveries presents with ongoing abdominal discomfort, irregular menstrual cycles, and a palpable mass on vaginal examination. Ultrasound confirms a 5 × 5 cm ovarian cyst. What is the most appropriate next step in her management?",
