      "statement": "Match the following conditions to their descriptions :\na. Depression 1. The feeling goes away as soon as you leave the hospital\nb. Suicide 2. State of emotional and physical exhaustion caused by prolonged stress, relieved after re-laxation\nc. Burnout 3. Difficult to diagnose due to the shell of phy-sician's pride\nd. Overworking 4. Women physicians, substance abuse, rela-tionship troubles",
