      "statement": "Match the following conditions to their descriptions :\na. Twilight state 1. Subnormal intelli-gence\nb. Oneiroid state 2. Impaired level of consciousness\nc. Oligophrenia 3. Persecution\nd. Paranoid ide-ation\n4. Oneirophrenia",
