      "statement": "Which of the following processes seen in Type 1 Diabetes Mellitus (DM) with low insulin levels lead to ketosis and ketonuria?\nA. Increased mobilization of fatty acids from adipose tissue\nB. Decreased beta-oxidation of fatty acids\nC. Decreased Acetyl CoA entering the TCA cycle\nD. Increased Beta-hydroxybutyrate dehydrogenase Choose the correct options :",
