      "statement": "The following values are given below:\nA. Km of an enzyme = 10 µM; kcat = 20s⁻¹\nB. Km of an enzyme = 200 nM; kcat = 50s⁻¹\nC. Km of an enzyme = 2 µM; kcat = 200s⁻¹\nD. Km of an enzyme = 4 µM; kcat = 200s⁻¹ The highest catalytic efficiency is seen in :",
