      "statement": "Match the following drugs with their respective antidotes. DRUGS ANTIDOTE\nA. Heparin 1. Levocarnitine\nB. Ethylene glycol 2. Protamine Sul-phate\nC. Hydrofluoric acid\n3. Fomepizole\nD. Valproate 4. Calcium gluco-nate",
