      "statement": "You are an assistant surgeon working in a CHC and 13 year old rape victim is brought to you by her parents with history of sexual assault by 22-year old male. The police from the concerned is not accompanying the victim. The victim is refusing to give consent for the medical examination and any further tests. What should be done in the above given scenario? 1 Start treatment for STD and pregnancy 2 Inform the police 3 Record refusal of consent 4 Take vaginal samples 5 Start medical examination",
