      "statement": "A 35-year-old man with a history of peptic ulcer disease presents with 2 days of abdominal pain and obstipation. An erect abdominal X-ray is obtained (as shown). What should be the next step in management?\na. USG abdomen\nb. IV fluids\nc. Exploratory laparotomy\nd. Keep the patient in observation",
